# Environment configuration
#
# Nothing is required for Step 1. This file exists so future steps have
# an established place to document new environment variables without
# restructuring the project.
#
# This is a browser application: any variables added here (and prefixed
# with VITE_, per Vite's convention) will be embedded in the client
# bundle at build time. They are NOT server-side secrets. When the
# Gemini integration is added in a later step, its client-side API key
# will live here as a VITE_-prefixed variable — never hardcoded in
# source, and never committed (see .gitignore).
#
# Example (not active yet):
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
